  "id": "retrospective-memory",
  "term": "retrospective memory",
  "definition": "Retrospective memory is the remembered account or evaluation of experiences after they have already happened, rather than the experience as it was felt in the moment. This recall can differ from real-time experience and may be shaped more by especially intense, particularly negative, or final moments.",
